# Title screen to the main menu, "1P Mode" highlighted. Run with the default
# --scene title. Other scripts can start by copying these steps.
wait "state 0 scene 0$"
# The title screen ignores Start for its first moments, so press until it
# leaves.
press Start until "boot scene: game mode"
# Unlock notices come first: with no memory card the base port builds a save
# with everything unlocked but no notice marked as seen (gmmain_lib.c), so
# every run shows them. A dismisses each one; they take a press every 0.3 s,
# where the default 1.5 s spent 11 s on the eight of them.
press A until "boot scene: state 0 scene 1$" 20 0.3
